The displacement is $\underset{\sim}{d}=8\underset{\sim}{i}+5\underset{\sim}{j}$ km.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=5mm,y=5mm,every node/.style={text=black,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont}]
\definecolor{vectorBlue}{HTML}{268CFF}
\draw[->,draw=black,thick] (0,0)--(8,0);
\draw[->,draw=black,thick] (8,0)--(8,5);
\draw[->,draw=vectorBlue,thick] (0,0)--(8,5);
\draw[draw=black] (7.6,0)--(7.6,0.4)--(8,0.4);
\path (4,0) node[below] {$8\text{ km east}$};
\path (8,2.5) node[right] {$5\text{ km north}$};
\path (3.5,2.7) node[above left] {$\underset{\sim}{d}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

$\begin{aligned}|\underset{\sim}{d}|&=\sqrt{8^2+5^2}\\&=\sqrt{89}\\&\approx9.43\end{aligned}$

The final displacement has magnitude $9.43$ km.
